msgid "This connection can run everyday actions. Ask the customer before you change anything. Restoring, rolling back, reinstalling, deleting, cancelling, ordering servers and databases and passwords are not available on this connection: the customer connects again with Full access for that, and domain transfers always stay in the dashboard."
